I built a single ComfyUI node that replaces the entire Krea 2 workflow. No KSampler, no CLIPTextEncode, no LoadImage, no separate VAEDecode chain. One node handles both Krea 2 Turbo and Krea 2 Raw, text to image and image to image, full LoRA support up to 20 slots, and outputs that plug straight into anything else on your canvas.

In this video I walk through the two model tabs, the sampler options, a full text to image demo using my AI Prompt Builder, and a full image to image demo with a character LoRA, the source image browser, and the settings that actually matter for getting clean results.

